  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Documented aid — not Live",
      "items": [
        "A readable map of the runtime, not a production status claim. GAME_SPEC wins; C rooms, Gunner duration and FR-4 stay author-deferred.",
        "Formal IDs: NFR-1 and NFR-10 (deterministic engine), NFR-8 (fail closed on unported rules). Decision: ADR-0008."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Parity via golden recordings",
      "items": [
        "godot-golden.mjs runs the TS engine on fixed placements and records every turn; the godot workflow fails if the recording is stale or the GDScript replay differs.",
        "Simulated: CI tests only. The Godot scenes replay engine events and never decide an outcome."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Exports",
      "items": [
        "Web build is published at /godot/ by deploy-godot. Android debug APK, Windows and Linux builds are CI artifacts only.",
        "The Android debug key is generated per CI run, so a new APK needs an uninstall first. No release signing, no store upload."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Deploy approval",
      "items": [
        "deploy-web and deploy-godot run in the production environment and wait for a manual approval. Runs stack up until approved; a newer waiting run can replace an older one.",
        "Probed 2026-11-14: /godot/ still served the round-6 build while the round-7 and round-8 deploys waited."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Caching",
      "items": [
        "Probed 2026-11-14 (HTTPS HEAD): Cache-Control no-cache on /, /index.html, SPA fallback routes and /godot/."
      ]
    }
  ]
